name gtrlib-largetrees
category Package
revision 49062
shortdesc Library for genealogytree aiming at large trees
relocated 1
longdesc The main goal of this package is to offer additional database
longdesc fields and formats for the genealogytree package, particularly
longdesc for typesetting large trees. The package depends on
longdesc genealogytree and etoolbox.
